---
// Answer-first opener: the key fact in one or two sentences, directly under the H1.
---
<div class="answer"><slot /></div>
<style>
  .answer {
    max-width: 68ch; background: var(--sheet); border-left: 4px solid var(--mark);
    padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0; margin: 4px 0 8px;
  }
  .answer :global(p) { margin: 0; }
  .answer :global(p + p) { margin-top: 6px; }
</style>
